<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-18T14:22:43.561Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:22:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Trump arrived in Manila for an Asia trip, meeting Philippine leaders and discussing defence and economic deals, while the Philippines and India announced expanded maritime security cooperation. The Philippine Coast Guard reported 19 Chinese vessels operating around Ayungin Shoal and nearby features from Nov. 9 to 16, prompting Tarriela to criticize China’s actions. Australia and the Philippines signed a new defence cooperation arrangement, and ASEAN leaders met but a South China Sea code of conduct remains unlikely. The UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/17/world/canada/carney-china-xi-trade-apec.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/18/world/canada/trump-carney-meeting-asia-us-canada-trade.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9SMjBaUkhva3F0V2lNb3pUanRWRDRjdjNreFRyc1cxMzlxMXBIMVJRR3RIUnFMSUZpQUtYMDlnM0NWLXVqU0tnampxRWphSjB2cUtlaUtJTUVoNTdVdE5SWDQxRUZibWRuYVRtVEt1cjFNRkQya0gtTk5R?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/16/canada-carney-cars-evs-tariffs-xi-jinping-china-trump-trade-talks&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxNSk9XMnFCVmtld3lMMFh1SFN0cTd5dWprOTNyczlnYmhQRWR6LWpsRmZ4elRha0VaN0Nuc1lVOHlmQVYzaWpaYld0bDVCZkMtNlUySE1WTUVYRHlsMjAybHl0MTJac3preTlaRFU3T2puNXdkQmI1eVVGMmFSZkllbnZwUUtTQTRXS2VldTJTNDZPN1ZaeW0tSXhpYWh6SWRaZmFjUVFwRHFKOEFSc3Nnb2N5ZXVwb28?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3374907/carney-hails-real-progress-china-canada-ties-suggests-us-has